{"version":2,"width":120,"height":30,"timestamp":1791996000,"title":"Claude Code 2.1.300 (fullscreen renderer): a task typed into the input box pinned to the bottom of the alternate screen","env":{"TERM":"xterm-256color"},"pm":{"agent":"claude","agent_version":"2.1.300","initial_status":"idle","bug":"Round 13 #2: on some machines Claude starts its fullscreen renderer (alternate screen, input box pinned to the bottom rows, effort row above the box). The readiness recogniser was written against the classic layout; this cast shows it reads the pinned box as Empty and delivers the task.","source":["Live capture 2026-10-15: claude 2.1.300 in a ConPTY (120x30) with CLAUDE_CODE_NO_FLICKER=1, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=D:/pm-scratch-r13/claude-cfg (never ~/.claude), a fake ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL pointing at a local stand-in for the Messages API, so no account or network was used. Folder: D:/pm-scratch-r13/proj.","Output events are kept up to 1.95 s (the fresh screen). The reactions are the bytes Claude really wrote when the task was typed (6.01 s) and submitted (6.90 s). The recording tool and the stand-in API are described in docs/features/claude-fullscreen-renderer.md."]}}
